{"unit_id":"LUgABeEEE__dsh-adapt-packs#card-zh","repo":"LUgABeEEE/dsh-adapt-packs","commit":"a165ca7d71a10de06435dd40967a2ca44145a60f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-adapt-packs（DSH 插件，手机 Web 客户端）：为 DSH mobile 提供可选的移动界面适配包和第三方插件兼容清单。它通过 DSH bundle 注册主机 API，并在设置页加入「插件适配」面板，供用户查看适配包、安装状态和兼容结论。适配包可为插件面板控件补足触控尺寸、收窄超宽面板、为右下浮动控件留出滚动空间，也能调整外壳侧栏的触控区域。适合在手机上使用 DSH mobile、需要修正第三方插件布局的用户；无需 API 密钥，按需安装，适配包默认关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:165-173","lib/client.js:157-183","packs/core-panel/mobile.css:28-77","packs/floaters/mobile.js:49-75"]}
{"unit_id":"LUgABeEEE__dsh-adapt-packs#card-en","repo":"LUgABeEEE/dsh-adapt-packs","commit":"a165ca7d71a10de06435dd40967a2ca44145a60f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-adapt-packs is a DSH mobile plugin with optional adaptation packs and a compatibility list. Its Settings panel lets users inspect, install, and remove packs. Packs enlarge touch targets, constrain wide panels, and clear space around floating widgets. No API key is needed; packs default to off.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:165-173","lib/client.js:157-183","packs/core-panel/mobile.css:28-77","packs/floaters/mobile.js:49-75"]}
