{"unit_id":"LUgABeEEE__dsh-adapt-packs#feature-panel-touch-targets","repo":"LUgABeEEE/dsh-adapt-packs","commit":"a165ca7d71a10de06435dd40967a2ca44145a60f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-adapt-packs 的功能「插件面板触控尺寸」：在手机粗指针环境下，为插件面板中的按钮、输入控件和图标按钮补足触控尺寸，并在窄屏收回过宽的面板根节点。适配仅在对应扩展安装后生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["packs/core-panel/mobile.css:28-70"]}
{"unit_id":"LUgABeEEE__dsh-adapt-packs#feature-shell-touch-targets","repo":"LUgABeEEE/dsh-adapt-packs","commit":"a165ca7d71a10de06435dd40967a2ca44145a60f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-adapt-packs 的功能「外壳触控尺寸」：把 DSH 手机侧栏中的会话/项目行、按钮和折叠轨道控件的命中区域提升到 44px，并为返回栏提供不压低宿主尺寸的下限。","source":"generated","evidence":["packs/shell-chrome/mobile.css:35-68"]}
{"unit_id":"LUgABeEEE__dsh-adapt-packs#feature-floating-clearance","repo":"LUgABeEEE/dsh-adapt-packs","commit":"a165ca7d71a10de06435dd40967a2ca44145a60f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-adapt-packs 的功能「浮动控件避让」：扫描贴近屏幕右下角的固定浮动控件，测量其占用高度并设置页面让位值，帮助面板末尾内容保持可滚动。","source":"generated","evidence":["packs/floaters/mobile.js:49-75"]}
{"unit_id":"LUgABeEEE__dsh-adapt-packs#feature-settings-compat","repo":"LUgABeEEE/dsh-adapt-packs","commit":"a165ca7d71a10de06435dd40967a2ca44145a60f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-adapt-packs 的功能「设置页管理适配包」：在 DSH 设置中展示适配包目录、安装状态和兼容清单，并提供安装与卸载操作；卸载操作对应把包移出已启用目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:157-183","lib/index.mjs:123-151"]}
